<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.offer.reads ~ what waits, and what the wiki already carries

Every wiki wears promotion capability; its edge holds (face, wiki, digest). The AI prepares and flags; the hand commits and raises. The wiki rides `--wiki` (absent: the daemon wiki), the face `--face N`, and every answer prints as JSON.

`trust list` reads the wiki's promotions: the items waiting for a decision and the rows already carried. It writes nothing.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ the-daemon-wiki · one-wiki

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-daemon-wiki` params=`~ list the daemon wiki's promotions`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-wiki` params=`wiki/garden ~ list one wiki's promotions`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ wiki · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wiki` params=`takes/wiki-name ~ the wiki the promotion belongs to; absent, the daemon wiki`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ which face's promotion plane this call reads or acts on, by persona index (a whole number from 0)`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ read

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`read` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a read of the promotion board; it writes nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ face-malformed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`cure/[[realm.offer.reads face/1]] ~ --face names a persona index, a whole number from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ listed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[waiting rows]] ~ the waiting items and the carried rows, as JSON`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares trust list

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares trust list]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

